  description: '3 Level 7 monsters

    Once per turn, you can also Xyz Summon "Full
    Armored Dark Knight Lancer" by using 1 Rank 5 or 6 Xyz Monster you control. (Transfer
    its materials to this card.) Gains 300 ATK for each material and Equip Card it
    has. Once per turn: You can target 1 "Xyz" card in your GY; add it to your hand.
    Once per turn, if an Equip Card becomes equipped to a monster you control (except
    during the Damage Step): You can attach 1 monster your opponent controls to this
    card as material.'
